       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-THERM-SHEAR.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-THERM-SHEAR-PROOFS.
           05  WS-DIFFUSION-OK             PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SPECKLE-SHEAR-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CONDUCTANCE-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SHEAR-LATENCY-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SHEAR-SEAL-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-THERM-SHEAR-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PTT-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PTT-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-DIFFUSE-AND-SPECKLE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-CONDUCT-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PTT-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-DIFFUSE-AND-SPECKLE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DIFFUSION-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SPECKLE-SHEAR-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-CONDUCT-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CONDUCTANCE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-SHEAR-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PTT-PROOFS.
           IF WS-DIFFUSION-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SPECKLE-SHEAR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CONDUCTANCE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-SHEAR-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SHEAR-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PTT-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PTT-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PTT-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PTT-CODE.
